    "Snoring": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ronquido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snoring: %lld events · %.1f min": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ronquidos: %lld eventos · %.1f min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Somnia guides and documents, but doesn’t diagnose. If you notice breathing pauses or a lot of daytime tiredness, talk to a doctor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somnia orienta y documenta, pero no diagnostica. Si notas pausas al respirar o mucho cansancio de día, coméntalo con un médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Somnia listens while you sleep, detects snoring, coughing, speech and movement, and shows you how your night went. Before you start:": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somnia escucha mientras duermes, detecta ronquidos, tos, habla y movimiento, y te muestra cómo fue tu noche. Antes de empezar:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speech": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Habla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start monitoring": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iniciar monitoreo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start monitoring and lock the phone: Somnia keeps listening in the background. Avoid closing it from the app switcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicia el monitoreo y bloquea el teléfono: Somnia sigue escuchando en segundo plano. Evita cerrarla desde el selector de apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start when you go to bed. Audio is processed on your phone; nothing leaves the device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicia al acostarte. El audio se procesa en tu teléfono; nada sale del dispositivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detener"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summary": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resumen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session and its audio clips will be deleted. This can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se borrarán la sesión y sus clips de audio. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The whole night isn’t recorded: only short clips of each detected sound. Everything is analyzed and stored on your phone; audio isn’t uploaded to any server or included in backups.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se graba la noche completa: solo clips cortos de cada sonido detectado. Todo se analiza y guarda en tu teléfono; el audio no se sube a ningún servidor ni se incluye en respaldos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To monitor your sleep, allow microphone access for Somnia in Settings. Audio is processed only on your phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para monitorear tu sueño, permite el acceso al micrófono para Somnia en Ajustes. El audio se procesa solo en tu teléfono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trends": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tendencias"
          }
        }
      }
    },
